# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in what you need, then restart the
# server. Everything is optional: the IFC viewer, the analysis tools and the
# in-browser Revit reader work with no keys at all.
#
# .env.local stays on your machine. These values are read by the server-side
# API routes only and are never sent to the browser.

# --- AI assistant (IFC and RVT viewers) ------------------------------------
# An Anthropic API key from https://platform.claude.com/ . Usage is billed to
# your Anthropic account.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# Optional. Defaults to claude-sonnet-5-5.
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-sonnet-5-5

# --- Autodesk Platform Services (RVT cloud conversion, NWD viewer) ---------
# Create an app at https://aps.autodesk.com/ with the Data Management and
# Model Derivative APIs, and paste its client id and secret here.
# Translations use your APS quota.
APS_CLIENT_ID=
APS_CLIENT_SECRET=
# Optional. Where uploads are stored: US (default), EMEA, AUS, CAN, DEU, IND, JPN or GBR.
# The NWD viewer has been set up for US, EMEA and AUS.
# APS_REGION=US
# Optional. A bucket name of your own (lower-case letters, digits, underscore).
# By default one is derived from the client id. Uploads are kept for 24 hours.
# APS_BUCKET=
